        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>一天考过科目一 最全知识点</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 16px 24px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n    color: #000;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #ffe94d;\n    padding: 0 1px;\n  }\n  p.line {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  p.indent1 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 44px;\n  }\n  p.indent2 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 30px;\n  }\n  .stamp {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 78px;\n    right: 42px;\n    width: 96px;\n    height: 52px;\n    border: 3px solid #e8483f;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .stamp span {\n    background: #ffe94d;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n  }\n  .sub-cols {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 60px;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .sub-cols .item { display: inline-block; }\n  .sub-cols .gap { display: inline-block; width: 46px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">一天考过科目一—最全知识点！</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"stamp\"><span>超全</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"hl\">三、酒驾相关</span></div>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">1.公安机关交通管理部门<span class=\"hl\">约束至酒醒。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">2.处<span class=\"hl\">200-2000</span>元罚款，吊销驾驶证。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">3.<span class=\"hl\">五年内</span>不得重新取得机动车驾驶证。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">4.血液酒精含量：</p>\n  <div class=\"sub-cols\">\n    <span class=\"item\">a)<span class=\"hl\">20-80mg</span>/ml，酒驾；</span><span class=\"gap\"></span><span class=\"item\">b)<span class=\"hl\">80-100mg</span>/ml，醉驾。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"hl\">四、行驶</span></div>\n\n  <p class=\"line\">1.通过路口<span class=\"hl\">交替使用远近光灯。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">2.不靠山体的车比较危险，<span class=\"hl\">会车时先走。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">3.高速路会车时，<span class=\"hl\">150米外</span>，改为近光灯。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">4.<span class=\"hl\">站3口5:</span>在站点（公交车站，消防站等）30米内，路口、窄路等50米内不得停车。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">5.实习期间，应让<span class=\"hl\">3年以上驾龄</span>陪驾。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">6.在路口，靠路口中心点位应该<span class=\"hl\">左侧转弯</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">7.<span class=\"hl\">右方道路来车先行</span>，然后看谁的右方没车就谁先行。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">8.<span class=\"hl\">转弯车辆让直行车辆先行。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">9.准备进入环形路口的让<span class=\"hl\">已在路口内的车</span>先行。</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">10.右转弯车让左转弯车辆先行如遇特殊车辆执行任务，不受规则限制，<span class=\"hl\">应直接让行。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">11.当路口没有交通信号灯时，<span class=\"hl\">减速慢行。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">12.路口已经过了转弯的地点，只能继续向前行驶</p>\n  <p class=\"line\">13.驾驶机动车在道路上追逐竞驶，情节恶劣<span class=\"hl\">处拘役，并处罚金</span></p>\n  <p class=\"line\">14.撞人问题:是否逃逸，逃逸与死亡时间前后</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">a)撞人没逃逸，<span class=\"hl\">3年以下；</span></p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">b)撞人逃跑或撞伤逃跑后，未致人死亡，<span class=\"hl\">3~7年；</span></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
